<title>BAHRAIN: Fire destroys restaurant in Bahraini village.</title>
<headline>Fire destroys restaurant in Bahraini village.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A fire has completely gutted a Turkish-operated restaurant in a Bahraini village, residents said.</p>
<p>They said a fire broke out at Shul'ala restaurant in the early hours on Saturday in al-Daih village, five km (three miles) west of the capital Manama.</p>
<p>It was not immediately clear what caused the fire or if there were any casualties.</p>
<p>Government officials had no immediate comment.</p>
</text>
